     A                                             'OtherID')
     A            X5ROIQ    R               REFFLD(DS2)
     A                                      COLHDG('Rendering Provider' +
     A                                             'OtherID Qualifier')
     A            X5RNPI    R               REFFLD(DS17)
     A                                      COLHDG('Rend Prov' 'NPI')
